Z||000005||Rodney||08-05-2001||07:58 PM||||The straps stop the rear deck lid from hitting the rear of your roof. In time they fail and break in half. These are the cables mounted to the hinge assemblies. Maybe I should have called them rear deck lid limit cables? ||||reg||1
